{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52269","headline":"诗（幷序） 三十 · 王梵志","name":"诗（幷序） 三十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"愚人痴涳涳，常守无明塚。\n飘入阔海中，出头兼没顶。\n手擎金玉行，不解随身用。\n昏昏消好日，顽皮不转动。\n广贪世间乐，故故招枷棒。\n罪根渐渐深，命绝何人送。\n积金作宝山，气绝谁将用。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52269.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52269","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}